[FeeFollowModule.sol#L75-L91](https://github.com/code-423n4/2022-02-aave-lens/blob/c1d2de2b0609b7d2734ada2ce45c91a73cc54dd9/contracts/core/modules/follow/FeeFollowModule.sol#L75-L91)  

