The code above shows how transaction output value is handled in the btc-staking.ts file, from the first pointer it can be noted that outputValue is checked to ensure it is not below BTC_DUST_SAT value, the problem is that after this check is done estimated fee is subtracted later in the code as noted from the second pointer above, this opens up the possibility of still having the problem that the dust check was trying to prevent in the first place as:
