Problem occurs when both MAXPNLFACTORFORDEPOSITS and MAXPNLFACTORFORWITHDRAWALS have different values.

There are 2 possible scenarios:
MAXPNLFACTORFORWITHDRAWALS is less than MAXPNLFACTORFORDEPOSITS 

In this case, when the user wants to deposit the maximum allowed amount based on MAXPNLFACTORFORDEPOSITS transaction will most likely revert because there will be a different price of lpToken returned from the GMXOracle called with the pnlFactor = MAXPNLFACTORFORWITHDRAWALS, instead of the one for deposits.
MAXPNLFACTORFORWITHDRAWALS is more than MAXPNLFACTORFORDEPOSITS 

