This is function `_updateRewards()` code in `RewardTracker` in GMX protocol (<https://github.com/gmx-io/gmx-contracts/blob/65e62b62aadea5baca48b8157acb9351249dbaf1/contracts/staking/RewardTracker.sol#L272-L286>):
