When markets are removed from usage in a vault, their weight is set to 0. However, market is actually being used.
The only way to remove a market in Vault.sol is by updating the market weight and leverage to 0 with updateMarket. However, the market will still be listed as a market, amount to be paid whenever a position is changed.
This results in the market's settlementFee being excluded from vault users claim amounts, effectively resulting in a material loss of funds for vault users.
Markets can't be removed from use in a vault without incurring a loss of user funds with each claim.
