The new feature introduced in 2.1 is the callback called for all markets and
market+account pairs which requested the oracle version. These callbacks are
called once the corresponding oracle settles. For this reason, KeeperOracle keeps a
list of markets and market+account pairs per oracle version to call market.update
on them:
/// @dev Mapping from version to a set of registered markets for settlement
callback
