if (!_isInternal) {
    token.safeTransferFrom(tokenIssuer, address(this), _totalAmount);
}
```
`transferVesting()` function is also vulnerable to that issue because it uses the same check as `createVesting()`.

[SecondSwap_VestingDeployer.sol#L218-L228](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-12-secondswap/blob/214849c3517eb26b31fe194bceae65cb0f52d2c0/contracts/SecondSwap_VestingDeployer.sol#L218-L228)
