uint256 memFloatingDebt = floatingDebt;
maturity,
maxFuturePools,
floatingUtilization(memFloatingAssetsAverage, memFloatingDebt),
globalUtilization(memFloatingAssetsAverage, memFloatingDebt,
floatingBackupBorrowed)
);
```

